### send test notification

POST {{port6012}}/notify/send-test HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "This is a test notification from postman",
  "metaData": {
    "action": "meta action",
    "actionId": "12345abcde",
    "extra": {
      "deeplink": "myapp://friends/requests",
      "priority": "high",
      "sound": "ping"
    },
    "messagePreview": "meta message preview"
  },
  "notificationChannel": "BOTH",
  "receiverId": "69b39c437fcfe6424bad761e",
  "senderId": "69b28477dd104bd62ad45b4b",
  "title": "Send test notification",
  "type": "SYSTEM"
}


### my notifications

# / isRead=> true, false, all

GET {{port6012}}/notify/my?page=1&limit=20&isRead=all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{seller}}


### get single notification and marks as read

GET {{port6012}}/notify/single/019c7952-83f2-7b31-94e5-497c2b2ec6ba HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{client}}


### get notification unread count

GET {{port6012}}/notify/unread-count HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{seller}}


### mark all as read or unread

PATCH {{port6012}}/notify/mark-all HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{client}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isRead": false
}
